  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN Summit is currently underway in Manila, attracting top leaders from across the region and global powers. Participants, including President Prabowo Subianto of Indonesia, Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim of Malaysia, and President Lee Jae Myung of South Korea, have arrived to engage in high-level multilateral discussions. The summit agenda emphasizes regional stability, with specific attention toward strengthening joint military deterrence, as seen in recent defense engagements between the Philippines and Australia. A primary focus for leaders like Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim remains the reinforcement of ASEAN's centrality in the geopolitical landscape. The event involves a rigorous schedule of meetings, formal family photos, and bilateral side-talks, as officials balance internal summit commitments with concurrent global diplomatic responsibilities. The summit serves as a focal point for debating economic and security strategies amidst a complex international environment.",
